1
00:00:00,517 --> 00:00:02,427
(Amy:)I told her what a good guy you are,

2
00:00:02,586 --> 00:00:04,756
(Amy:)but she thought it was a bad sign

3
00:00:04,921 --> 00:00:06,871
(Amy:)that you didn't write
to her yourself.

4
00:00:07,023 --> 00:00:11,033
(Amy:)She thought it made you seem
too shy and passive.

5
00:00:11,194 --> 00:00:12,534
(Raj:)I'm not too shy and passive.

6
00:00:12,696 --> 00:00:14,936
(Raj:)You write her back
and tell her I said that.

7
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:18,139
(Leonard:)You know,
when you have a second.

8
00:00:19,603 --> 00:00:22,143
(Amy:)Look, I'll see if I can change
her mind tomorrow night.

9
00:00:22,305 --> 00:00:23,755
(Raj:)What's happening tomorrow night?

10
00:00:23,907 --> 00:00:25,647
(Amy:)I'm meeting her for coffee.

11
00:00:26,309 --> 00:00:27,309
(Raj:)What?

12
00:00:27,477 --> 00:00:30,147
(Amy:)We emailed back and forth a bit,
and we kind of hit it off.

13
00:00:30,313 --> 00:00:32,223
(Raj:)I find a girl I like,
and you're stealing her?

14
00:00:32,382 --> 00:00:34,722
(Amy:)No. We just ended up
having a lot in common.

15
00:00:34,884 --> 00:00:36,664
(Amy:)We went to Harvard,
we like Chaucer,

16
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,490
were both hardcore into quilting.

17
00:00:42,592 --> 00:00:46,302
(Raj:)Your words fall like acid rain
on the wounded petals of my heart.

18
00:00:49,499 --> 00:00:52,449
(Howard:)That's Sheldon.
He says he'll be down in a minute.

19
00:00:53,603 --> 00:00:55,413
(Bernadette:)-What are you doing?

20
00:00:55,472 --> 00:00:57,012
(Howard:)He's not coming out
until he sees proof

21
00:00:57,173 --> 00:01:01,023
(Howard:)you don't have an air freshener
in your car.

